{
  "diagnostics": [],
  "html": "<h1>Block Image Category Keys</h1>\n<div class=\"sect1\">\n<h2 id=\"image\">image</h2>\n<div class=\"sectionbody\">\n<div class=\"paragraph\">\n<p>The keys in the <code>image</code> category control the arrangement and style of block images.</p>\n</div>\n<table class=\"tableblock frame-none grid-rows stretch\">\n<colgroup>\n<col style=\"width: 23.0769%;\">\n<col style=\"width: 30.7692%;\">\n<col style=\"width: 46.1539%;\">\n</colgroup>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\">Key</th>\n<th class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\">Value Type</th>\n<th class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\">Example</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\">align</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\"><a href=\"blocks.html#align\">Block alignment</a><br>\n(default: <code>left</code>)</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"listingblock\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-yaml\" data-lang=\"yaml\">image:\n  align: right</code></pre>\n</div>\n</div></div></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\"><a href=\"#border-color\">border-color</a></p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\"><a href=\"blocks.html#border-color\">Color</a><br>\n(default: <em>not set</em>)</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"listingblock\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-yaml\" data-lang=\"yaml\">image:\n  border-color: #CCCCCC</code></pre>\n</div>\n</div></div></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\"><a href=\"#fit\">border-fit</a></p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\"><code>content</code> | <code>auto</code><br>\n(default: <code>content</code>)</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"listingblock\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-yaml\" data-lang=\"yaml\">image:\n  border-fit: auto</code></pre>\n</div>\n</div></div></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\">border-radius</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\"><a href=\"blocks.html#radius\">Measurement</a><br>\n(default: <em>not set</em>)</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"listingblock\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-yaml\" data-lang=\"yaml\">image:\n  border-radius: 2</code></pre>\n</div>\n</div></div></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\">border-style</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\"><a href=\"blocks.html#border-style\">Border style</a><br>\n(default: <code>solid</code>)</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"listingblock\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-yaml\" data-lang=\"yaml\">image:\n  border-style: dashed</code></pre>\n</div>\n</div></div></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\">border-width</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\"><a href=\"blocks.html#border-width\">Measurement</a> | <a href=\"blocks.html#border-width\">Measurement[]</a><br>\n(default: <em>not set</em>)</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"listingblock\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-yaml\" data-lang=\"yaml\">image:\n  border-width: 0.5</code></pre>\n</div>\n</div></div></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\">float-gap</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\"><a href=\"measurement-units.html\">Measurement</a> | <a href=\"measurement-units.html\">Measurement[side,bottom]</a><br>\n(default: <code>[12, 6]</code>)</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"listingblock\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-yaml\" data-lang=\"yaml\">image:\n  float-gap: 12</code></pre>\n</div>\n</div></div></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\"><a href=\"#width\">width</a></p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\"><a href=\"measurement-units.html\">Measurement</a><br>\n(default: <em>not set</em>)</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"listingblock\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-yaml\" data-lang=\"yaml\">image:\n  width: 100%</code></pre>\n</div>\n</div></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"sect2\">\n<h3 id=\"noborder-role\">noborder role</h3>\n<div class=\"paragraph\">\n<p>If the <code>noborder</code> role is present on a block image, the border is not drawn on that image even if the border-related keys are defined on the <code>image</code> category in the theme.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"listingblock\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-asciidoc\" data-lang=\"asciidoc\">image::image-without-border.png[role=noborder]</code></pre>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sect2\">\n<h3 id=\"border-color\">border-color</h3>\n<div class=\"paragraph\">\n<p>A border is applied to a block image if <code>border-color</code> is specified, <code>border-width</code> is specified, the value of <code>border-width</code> is greater than zero, and the <code>noborder</code> role isn&#8217;t present.\nThe border is drawn above the image on the inside of the box reserved for the image.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sect2\">\n<h3 id=\"fit\">border-fit</h3>\n<div class=\"paragraph\">\n<p>When the value <code>auto</code> is assigned to the <code>border-fit</code> key the border will expand to fit the width of the container (i.e., full width) instead of the image.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sect2\">\n<h3 id=\"width\">width</h3>\n<div class=\"paragraph\">\n<p>The <code>width</code> key only applies to block images that don&#8217;t have either a <code>pdfwidth</code> or <code>scaledwidth</code> attribute on the image macro.\nIf <code>width</code> is specified, its value takes precedence over the value of the <code>width</code> attribute on the image macro, but not over the value of the <code>pdfwidth</code> or <code>scaledwidth</code> attributes.\nThe <code>width</code> key accepts the same values as the <code>pdfwidth</code> attribute.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sect1\">\n<h2 id=\"alt\">image-alt</h2>\n<div class=\"sectionbody\">\n<div class=\"paragraph\">\n<p>The keys in the <code>image-alt</code> category control the arrangement and style of the alt text of block images.</p>\n</div>\n<table class=\"tableblock frame-none grid-rows stretch\">\n<colgroup>\n<col style=\"width: 15.3846%;\">\n<col style=\"width: 38.4615%;\">\n<col style=\"width: 46.1539%;\">\n</colgroup>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\">Key</th>\n<th class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\">Value Type</th>\n<th class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\">Example</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\"><a href=\"#content\">content</a></p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\"><a href=\"quoted-string.html\">Quoted string</a><br>\n(default: \"%{link}[%{alt}]%{/link} | %{target}\")</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"listingblock\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-yaml\" data-lang=\"yaml\">image:\n  alt:\n    content: \"%{alt} (%{target})\"</code></pre>\n</div>\n</div></div></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\">font-color</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\"><a href=\"color.html\">Color</a><br>\n(default: <em>inherit</em>)</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"listingblock\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-yaml\" data-lang=\"yaml\">image:\n  alt:\n    font-color: #FF0000</code></pre>\n</div>\n</div></div></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\">font-family</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\"><a href=\"font-support.html\">Font family name</a><br>\n(default: <em>inherit</em>)</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"listingblock\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-yaml\" data-lang=\"yaml\">image:\n  alt:\n    font-family: Courier</code></pre>\n</div>\n</div></div></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\">font-kerning</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\"><code>normal</code> | <code>none</code><br>\n(default: <em>inherit</em>)</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"listingblock\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-yaml\" data-lang=\"yaml\">image:\n  alt:\n    font-kerning: none</code></pre>\n</div>\n</div></div></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\">font-size</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\"><a href=\"text.html#font-size\">Font size</a><br>\n(default: <em>inherit</em>)</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"listingblock\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-yaml\" data-lang=\"yaml\">image:\n  alt:\n    font-size: 9</code></pre>\n</div>\n</div></div></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\">font-style</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\"><a href=\"text.html#font-style\">Font style</a><br>\n(default: <code>normal</code>)</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"listingblock\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-yaml\" data-lang=\"yaml\">image:\n  alt:\n    font-style: italic</code></pre>\n</div>\n</div></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"sect2\">\n<h3 id=\"content\">content</h3>\n<div class=\"paragraph\">\n<p>The <code>content</code> key accepts the placeholders <code>%{alt}</code>, <code>%{target}</code>, <code>%{link}</code>, and <code>%{/link}</code>.\nThese placeholders insert the alt text, image target, and link open and close tags into the content template.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sect1\">\n<h2 id=\"caption\">image-caption</h2>\n<div class=\"sectionbody\">\n<div class=\"paragraph\">\n<p>The keys in the <code>image-caption</code> category control the arrangement and style of the captions for block images.\nMost of the keys listed on <a href=\"caption.html\">caption.html</a> can also be nested under the <code>image-caption</code> category to further customize the image captions.</p>\n</div>\n<table class=\"tableblock frame-none grid-rows stretch\">\n<colgroup>\n<col style=\"width: 20%;\">\n<col style=\"width: 40%;\">\n<col style=\"width: 40%;\">\n</colgroup>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\">Key</th>\n<th class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\">Value Type</th>\n<th class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\">Example</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\"><a href=\"block-images.html#caption-align\">caption-align</a></p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\"><a href=\"block-images.html#caption-align\">Block alignment</a> | <a href=\"block-images.html#caption-align\">inherit</a><br>\n(default: <code>$caption-align</code>)</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"listingblock\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-yaml\" data-lang=\"yaml\">image:\n  caption:\n    align: inherit</code></pre>\n</div>\n</div></div></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\"><a href=\"block-images.html#end\">caption-end</a></p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\"><a href=\"block-images.html#end\">End placement</a><br>\n(default: <code>bottom</code>)</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"listingblock\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-yaml\" data-lang=\"yaml\">image:\n  caption:\n    end: top</code></pre>\n</div>\n</div></div></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\"><a href=\"block-images.html#caption-max-width\">caption-max-width</a></p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\"><code>fit-content</code> | <code>fit-content</code>(percentage) | <code>none</code> | <a href=\"measurement-units.html\">Measurement</a><br>\n(default: <code>none</code>)</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"listingblock\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-yaml\" data-lang=\"yaml\">image:\n  caption:\n    max-width: fit-content</code></pre>\n</div>\n</div></div></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\"><a href=\"block-images.html#caption-text-align\">caption-text-align</a></p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\"><a href=\"block-images.html#caption-text-align\">Text alignment</a> | <a href=\"block-images.html#caption-text-align\">inherit</a><br>\n(default: <code>$image-caption-align</code>)</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"listingblock\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-yaml\" data-lang=\"yaml\">image:\n  caption:\n    text-align: center</code></pre>\n</div>\n</div></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n"
}
